"850MU",51.30, 1.00,"R",78.00,"COLLECTED FROM PERSONS OTHER THAN YOU IN CONNECTION WITH THIS APPLICATION FOR INSURANCE AND SUBSEQUENT"
"850MU",52.12, 1.00,"R",78.00,"AMENDMENTS AND RENEWALS.  SUCH INFORMATION AS WELL AS OTHER PERSONAL AND PRIVILEGED INFORMATION COLLECTED BY"
"850MU",52.94, 1.00,"R",78.00,"US OR OUR AGENTS MAY IN CERTAIN CIRCUMSTANCES BE DISCLOSED TO THIRD PARTIES WITHOUT YOUR AUTHORIZATION.  CREDIT"
"850MU",53.76, 1.00,"R",78.00,"SCORING INFORMATION MAY BE USED TO HELP DETERMINE EITHER YOUR ELIGIBILITY FOR INSURANCE OR THE PREMIUM YOU WILL"
